Muon 0.7.1
==========

Imported from the source archive linked by https://muon.build/:
https://dl.muon.build/v0.7.1/muon-v0.7.1.tar.gz
SHA-256: 956b5a74f7852ec4c57a11825dac79052da878da78f507bee1a0ef955053fbbb

Muon is GPL-3.0-only; individual bundled files retain their own notices.
The complete upstream LICENSES directory accompanies this import.

Belka adds machine recognition and an illumos linker backend. The build
uses external samurai and disables optional fetching, native backtraces
and documentation generation. The small portability changes expose the
existing BSD utimes interface and include termios.h for struct winsize.
